        {"zh": "我的牙上有毒，五秒就够。", "en": "My teeth are poisoned. Five seconds is enough."},
        {"zh": "注视着你，我变强大。", "en": "Stare at you, I grow stronger."},
        {"zh": "我的力量，来自你。", "en": "My strength, from you."},
        {"zh": "碰我一下，你就中毒。", "en": "One touch from me and you're poisoned."},
